#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donate"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Ditana is the result of years of work, built on the conviction that a Linux "
"distribution should explain its choices rather than hide them. It is "
"completely free and open source, and its continued development relies on "
"community support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"By donating, you enable me to keep enhancing Ditana — exploring new "
"features, responding to user feedback, and maintaining the level of detail "
"this project aims for. Every contribution makes a difference."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where donations go"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Donations are processed through **acrion innovations GmbH**, a Swiss company "
"I founded to manage the financial side of my projects. While the company "
"provides the legal and financial framework, **acrion** represents my work as "
"a solo developer. Your support directly funds Ditana's ongoing development, "
"server infrastructure, and the time required to keep up with Arch's rolling "
"release."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to support Ditana"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate) — recurring donations, "
"no platform fee."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion) — one-off support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion) — if you already "
"donate to other open-source work via GitHub."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev) — tiered support."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "Thank you for helping keep Ditana alive, growing, and uncompromising."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "— Stefan"
msgstr ""
